            "name": "Get Order Search",
            "description": {
              "content": "Searches tenant orders using optional filters and can return a maximum of 100 orders per request. Method: GETEndpoint: {{base_url}}/sales-channel/public/v2/tenants/orders/search This request is used to retrieve orders that match the supplied search criteria. Authentication appears to be required because the request uses the available {{access_token}} variable. This API can send a maximum of 100 orders only. All query parameters are optional unless otherwise indicated. Available query parameters ",
